reproducable in \n  - v4.7.beta5.mono.official [bbd3f43b5]\n  - v4.7.rc1.mono.official [a4f5e8cdd]\n- Not reproducable in\n - v4.6.stable.mono.official [89cea1439] and before\n - v4.7.beta2.mono.official [777579205]\n - v4.7.beta4.mono.official [dff2b9bb6]\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe `RichTextLabel` provides a function to control the indent level of a text.\nFrom the documentaion\n```\n● void push_indent(level: int)\nAdds an [indent] tag to the tag stack. Multiplies level by current tab_size to determine new margin length.\n```\nUsing `push_indent(1)` should indent the text by 4 spaces (default tab_size=4)\nUsing `push_indent(2)` should indent the text by 8 spaces (default tab_size=4)\n\nThis was never working and i used a workaround by calling multiple times `push_indent(1)` to get the correct level.\n```gd\nfor i in _level:\n\t_output.push_indent(1)\n...\nfor i in _level:\n\t_output.pop()\n\n```\nSince  v4.7.beta5.mono.official [bbd3f43b5] each `push_indent` call adds a new_line where is wrong and an regression.\n\n## Output\n- Before\n<img width=\"619\" height=\"212\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/cc3479a9-3edc-4d61-8195-f8cd96d6231c\" />\n\n- Since `v4.7.beta5`\n<img width=\"600\" height=\"272\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aa622c24-af95-4249-b794-2daba6db3bc8\" />\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nOpen the attached project to reproduce.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[rich-text-bug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28744697/rich-text-bug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","